{"v":1,"agent":"cursor","cli_version":"0.12.2","type":"assistant","content":[{"text":"I'll check how the current markdown preview is wired so we can see what a flexible CTA model would break.","type":"text"},{"input":{"pattern":"preview|MarkdownBody|richBody|mdx|prose","path":"/Users/blaise/Developer/cms/web/src/modules/content","glob":"**/*.{vue,ts}","head_limit":40},"name":"Grep","type":"tool_use"},{"input":{"pattern":"preview.*content|content.*preview|markdown.*preview|render.*md","path":"/Users/blaise/Developer/cms","glob":"**/*.{rs,ts,vue,js,md}","head_limit":40},"name":"Grep","type":"tool_use"},{"input":{"pattern":"richBody|markdown.*render|body.*preview|ContentPanel","path":"/Users/blaise/Developer/cms/docs/superpowers/specs","head_limit":30},"name":"Grep","type":"tool_use"},{"input":{"pattern":"rich|mdx|kind|unsupported|component","path":"/Users/blaise/Developer/cms/web/src/modules/content/MarkdownBodyEditor.vue","head_limit":40},"name":"Grep","type":"tool_use"},{"input":{"pattern":"richBody|mdx|MDX|kind.*markdown","path":"/Users/blaise/Developer/cms/src/content","head_limit":40},"name":"Grep","type":"tool_use"},{"input":{"path":"/Users/blaise/Developer/cms/docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-content-editor-design.md","offset":1,"limit":100},"name":"Read","type":"tool_use"},{"text":"Mostly no — it depends how you place the CTA.\n\n**Ordered sections in frontmatter** (CTA as a `type: cta` block in a list): your existing markdown body preview/editor keeps working. The body stays normal `.md`. The CTA is edited in **Fields**, and the live site **Preview** shows it wherever that list puts it.\n\n**Inline MDX in the body** (`\u003cCta … /\u003e` mid-article): that *does* break the rich markdown editor. Orso already treats MDX/JSX as unsupported for TipTap and stays in **Raw**. Site Preview can still render it if the page is MDX; the in-editor rich preview will not.\n\nSo for “CTA anywhere” without losing the current markdown experience: put position in an ordered **sections** field, not in the markdown body.","type":"text"}]}
