{"v":1,"agent":"cursor","cli_version":"0.12.2","type":"assistant","content":[{"text":"Good pick. `:::cta` is clear, Markdown-friendly, and fits a TipTap custom block without opening full MDX.\n\nSuggested shape (closing fence flush left):\n\n```md\n:::cta\nheading: Ready to launch?\nlabel: Get started\nhref: /pricing\n:::\n```\n\nThat keeps body prose editable in rich mode, CTA editable as a card, and Astro can render the same directive on the site.\n\nWant me to turn this into an implementation plan (editor node + round-trip + Astro render)?","type":"text"}]}
